{%- comment -%}
  NURVA PERFORMANCE — cart page section.

  Online Store -> Themes -> Edit code -> Sections -> Add a new section,
  name it  nurva-cart  (Shopify adds the .liquid), paste this in, Save.
  Then open your CART template (Edit code -> Templates -> cart.json,
  or Customize -> Cart page -> Add section) and add Nurva cart.

  Uses the page's own `cart` object automatically — nothing to pick.
  Styles are scoped under .nurva and cannot affect the rest of your theme.
{%- endcomment -%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@600;700;800&display=swap">

